    "description": "Snackbar shown after sign-up when the entered code was a valid consumer referral code. 'Bonus days' refers to pro_days_earned/pro_access_until, which today is only a tracked counter/badge — see referral_screen.dart — so this message must not imply a working paid feature was unlocked."
  },

  "signInInviteCodeFailed": "Couldn't apply that code: {error}",
